				Time="2011-11-27T12:10:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]博士『人間の
底力　みせてやるわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-11-27T12:10:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-11-27T12:10:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
